  subgraph cluster_phase_map_current_position {
    label="Global Phase Map Current Position\\nphase-map-current-position\\nready=0 nodes=9";
    color="gray70";
    penwidth="1.2";
    "phase-map-current-position::event:001" [label="继续新增：`design_docs/stages/planning-gate/2026-06-21-supervisor-storage-binding-evidence.md` 已完成。当前 supervisor storage/context binding 已具备 durable evidence 产品：`src.runtime.orchestration.supervisor_storage_binding_evidence` 新增 `SupervisorStorageBindingEvidence`、`SupervisorStorageBindingEvidenceWriteResult`、`SupervisorStorageBindingEvidenceSummary` 与 build/default-path/write/read-summary helpers，默认 evidence 路径为 `.codex/scheduler/evidence/<safe-id>.json`\\ncompleted", shape="ellipse", fillcolor="honeydew2"];
    "phase-map-current-position::event:002" [label="继续新增：`design_docs/stages/planning-gate/2026-06-21-supervisor-storage-binding-exchange-artifact-projection.md` 已完成。当前 supervisor storage binding evidence summary 已可投影为 compact `ExchangeArtifact`：`src.runtime.orchestration.supervisor_storage_binding_evidence` 新增 `SUPERVISOR_STORAGE_BINDING_ARTIFACT_PRODUCT_TYPE`、`SUPERVISOR_STORAGE_BINDING_ARTIFACT_SCHEMA_VERSION` 与 `supervisor_storage_binding_evidence_summary_to_artifact()`，生成 `retention` / `inform` artifact，并携带 `structured` summary、scheduler-readable `storage_manifest`、`evidence` payload、durable evidence file `ref` 与 compact projection `log`。artifact scope 只在单值 task/context/lane/runtime id 场景填充，多值事实保留在 structured payload\\ncompleted", shape="ellipse", fillcolor="honeydew2"];
    "phase-map-current-position::event:003" [label="继续新增：`design_docs/stages/planning-gate/2026-06-21-supervisor-storage-binding-artifact-admission-readiness.md` 已完成。当前 scheduler submissions 已具备 supervisor storage binding artifact exact-version input convention：`SUPERVISOR_STORAGE_BINDING_ARTIFACT_REF_KIND = \"supervisor_storage_binding_artifact\"`、`BindingArtifactReferenceValidation` 与 `validate_supervisor_storage_binding_artifact_refs()` 已落地\\ncompleted", shape="ellipse", fillcolor="honeydew2"];
    "phase-map-current-position::event:004" [label="继续新增：`design_docs/stages/planning-gate/2026-06-21-supervisor-storage-binding-reference-inspection-surface.md` 已完成。当前 exact stored scheduler submission 已具备 supervisor storage binding refs 的只读检查面：`BindingArtifactReferenceInspection` / `BindingArtifactReferenceTaskInspection` 与 `inspect_supervisor_storage_binding_artifact_refs_for_submission()` 可读取一个 exact `JsonArtifactVersionStore` artifact id/version，接受 `scheduler_task_submission` 或 `scheduler_task_batch_submission`，逐 task 复用现有 binding-ref validator，并返回 `supervisor_storage_binding_reference_inspection` 产品。CLI `doc-based-coding scheduler inspect-binding-refs` 与 MCP `schedulerBindingReferenceInspect` 现暴露同一产品\\ncompleted", shape="ellipse", fillcolor="honeydew2"];
    "phase-map-current-position::event:005" [label="继续新增：`design_docs/stages/planning-gate/2026-06-22-operator-workflow-binding-reference-inspection-step.md` 已完成。当前 shared scheduler operator workflow 已具备可选只读 binding-ref inspection step：`SchedulerOperatorWorkflowRequest.inspect_binding_refs` / CLI `doc-based-coding scheduler operator-workflow --inspect-binding-refs` / MCP `schedulerOperatorWorkflow.inspectBindingRefs` 可在 candidate inspection 后、admission 前读取 exact artifact id/version，并把 `supervisor_storage_binding_reference_inspection` 产品嵌入 workflow payload 的 `binding_reference_inspection`。默认未启用时保持既有五步 workflow payload 兼容\\ncompleted", shape="ellipse", fillcolor="honeydew2"];
    "phase-map-current-position::event:006" [label="继续新增：`design_docs/stages/planning-gate/2026-06-22-admission-ledger-binding-reference-summary.md` 已完成。当前 exact admission ledger/readback 已能在显式 binding-ref preflight 启用时记录 compact `binding_reference_summary`：`ExchangeArtifactAdmissionRecord.binding_reference_summary` 会在 old records 中默认为空，在 new binding-aware admitted/failed records 中携带 enabled/ok、source artifact id/version、submission product type、task/ref counts、errors 与 compact per-task task/ref/error clues。该 summary 由现有 `inspect_supervisor_storage_binding_artifact_refs_for_submission()` 生成，不保存 raw supervisor storage binding evidence JSON 或 raw binding payload\\ncompleted", shape="ellipse", fillcolor="honeydew2"];
    "phase-map-current-position::event:007" [label="继续新增：`design_docs/stages/planning-gate/2026-06-22-operator-dogfood-execution-evidence-closure.md` 已完成。当前 operator dogfood closure 已具备 deterministic fake-runtime backend/CLI 产品：`tools.progress_graph.scheduler_operator_dogfood_closure` 暴露 `SchedulerOperatorDogfoodClosureRequest`、`SchedulerOperatorDogfoodClosureResult` 与 `run_scheduler_operator_dogfood_closure()`\\ncompleted", shape="ellipse", fillcolor="honeydew2"];
    "phase-map-current-position::event:008" [label="继续新增：`design_docs/stages/planning-gate/2026-06-22-operator-dogfood-closure-mcp-surface.md` 已完成。当前 operator dogfood closure 已具备 Codex-facing MCP surface：`src.mcp.tools.GovernanceTools.scheduler_operator_dogfood_closure()` 与 MCP tool `schedulerOperatorDogfoodClosure` 复用 `SchedulerOperatorDogfoodClosureRequest` / `run_scheduler_operator_dogfood_closure()`，返回与 CLI/runtime 相同的 closure JSON shape。默认 `binding-consumer` fixture 可在 MCP 中完成 seed、binding-ref inspection、exact admission、successful admission 后 consumed lifecycle marking、bounded fake scheduler loop、scheduler projection refresh 与 Host Evidence presentation readback\\ncompleted", shape="ellipse", fillcolor="honeydew2"];
    "phase-map-current-position::reference:source-document" [label="design_docs/Global Phase Map and Current Position.md\\ncompleted", shape="note", fillcolor="honeydew2"];
    "phase-map-current-position::event:001" -> "phase-map-current-position::event:002" [style="solid", color="gray25"];
    "phase-map-current-position::event:002" -> "phase-map-current-position::event:003" [style="solid", color="gray25"];
